{"ID":"20240515131442-pl2fzx8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131442-pl2fzx8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131442-pl2fzx8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133315-eqr6bwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133315-eqr6bwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133315-eqr6bwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:554,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:554\u0026#125;","title":"021","type":"doc","updated":"20240515151952"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133315-eqr6bwc","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 851px;","id":"20240515133315-eqr6bwc","updated":"20240515151952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/8/19"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"42歲,體型壯碩"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左膝痛（開過刀）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙側腰眼部位痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平素喝酒過量。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倦怠、沮喪。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皰疹病史，服西藥中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"失眠、慢性鼻炎。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便每日一次，但不定時。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口不好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有，喜溫飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪數中空，一息六至（酒客病）。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白濕厚（中焦濕）。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清肝活血強腎。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方：\n左膝五針"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（陽陵泉透陰陵泉《平補平瀉》、鶴頂、膝眼）治療膝痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙側"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委中"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委中到承山間的壓痛點"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。（若把委中視為對應腰部、承山視為對應股部《承山可治療痔瘡》，則兩穴間即對應到腰臀間部位。病患主訴腰眼附近痛，在此兩穴間的膀胱經循行附近找痛點，此即為阿是穴《天應穴》，本法可精準找出相應痛點，針去痛癒。）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 黃芩三錢 龍膽草三錢 茜草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸棗仁三錢 白芍六錢 辛夷三錢 菖蒲三錢 蒼朮三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補骨脂三錢 巴戟天三錢 澤瀉五錢 女貞子三錢 炮附子四錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨三錢 牡蠣五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五帖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服1碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡、玉金、黃芩、龍膽草、茜草清肝中毒素，酸棗仁助眠。白芍能清肝且清除瘀血，也可對他的膝痛活血化瘀，故加量用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛夷、菖蒲治慢性鼻炎，蒼朮配澤瀉可除濕解酒，補骨脂、巴戟天補腎，加澤瀉平衡補瀉，女貞子潤肝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷以炮附子暖下焦，龍骨、牡蠣配酸棗仁安神助眠。酸棗仁可使血歸肝，魂歸肝則可眠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}